      "message": "[error] Line 326: 🔴 The temp-file path is deterministic (`img_\u003csha\u003e.\u003cext\u003e`) in a world-writable temp directory, then opened with `QFile::WriteOnly`. A local attacker can precreate a symlink at that predictable path and make the app overwrite an arbitrary user-writable file. Use `QTemporaryFile` (random name, opened atomically) and persist it with `setAutoRemove(false)`/`rename`, or otherwise create the file with an atomic exclusive-creation API before writing.",
